# Use Cases — TiendaAdmin POS

## Description

This directory contains the use case documentation for the TiendaAdmin Point of Sale (POS) system.

## Objective

Identify the system actors, their interactions with the application, and the main business processes supported by the POS.

## Main Actors

- **Administrator:** Manages system configuration, products, permissions, and reports.
- **Supervisor:** Authorizes restricted operations and supervises cash register activities.
- **Cashier:** Processes sales, manages assigned cash register shifts, and handles payments.

## Main Use Cases

- User authentication.
- Open and close cash register shifts.
- Register sales and process payments.
- Search products using barcodes.
- Manage inventory and stock adjustments.
- Apply promotions and discounts.
- Register cash inflows and outflows.
- Generate and reprint sales receipts.
- Consult sales history.
- Generate sales and profit reports.
- Synchronize inventory between two cash registers.

